## Acceptance criteria

- Larger reading text, unchanged button typography/targets/edge placement.
- Solid pastel faces and attachment strips; no washed-out fake-transparency effect.
- Opaque cream paper, with transparent logical gutters retaining protruding tabs.
- Four photographs per full page; never clipped content or smaller replacement text.
- Complete readable static fallback at genuinely impossible viewport/text combinations.
- No product image or local4174changes; no new image-tool views or social posting.

